# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs & temp
*.log
.cache/
tmp/
scratch/

# Environment / secrets
# Nothing secret should ever live in this repo (static site, public host),
# but ignore these anyway so a stray file never gets pushed.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
secrets.json

# Local dev servers / OS junk
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Node is NOT used in this project (no build step, no dependencies).
# Ignored defensively in case a tool ever drops these here.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# outreach/ IS committed, deliberately.
#
# It was excluded when this repo was public. The repo is private now, and
# committing it is the only way the prospect list survives switching between
# the Mac and the desktop.
#
# It is kept OFF the public website by .assetsignore, not by this file.
# Verified empirically: a canary file in outreach/ returned 404 on the live
# site while a control file at the repo root served correctly.
#
# >> If you ever make this repo public again, outreach/ must come back out.
#    It contains a home address and a list of businesses being solicited. <<
